## Why This Is Asked
Tests edge deployment, privacy-preserving CV, multi-camera fusion, and rapid adaptation to new attire in a security context.

## Key Concepts
- Edge inference, privacy-preserving anonymization, cross-camera re-ID, multi-camera tracking, 5-shot adaptation, latency.
- Synthetic+real data, losses for detection, embedding, privacy, and association.

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-code sketch for a privacy-preserving forward pass
function forward(frame, model) {
  const det = model.detect(frame);
  const emb = model.embed(det.boxes);
  const blurred = blurFaces(frame, det.faces);
  return { blurred, det, emb };
}
```

